    "text": "Froth flotation method is used for concentration of sulphide ores.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>Galena</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math><br /><br />Malachite is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cu</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br /><br />Magnetite is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math><br /><br />Siderite is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math><br />&nbsp;",
